{
    "title": "Mini Block Craft Realm Craft",
    "description": "Welcome to <p>RealmCraft Block Building and Survival Craft</p>.\u00a0\r\nExplore realm cube world, fight with realm mobs, destroy realm caves and build block.\r\n\r\nGet ready for real Adventures! Because, Realmcraft is realm universe of mini blocky cube world. Realm game has endless open 3D cubic world and is one of the best mini block building simulator and mini craft for real craftsman!\r\n\r\n<p><font color=\"#1d662b\">Features of Realm Craft</font></p>\r\n~ Fascinating <p><i>open block world</i></p> in which everything consists of 3D cubes and block.\r\n\r\n~ <p><i>World creating</i></p>. Destroy blocks and cubes, collect block, build block, move realm as you like and create your own mini cube building as craftsman;\u00a0\r\nCut wood, break stones, mine block and create out of them building and crafting of your dreams!\r\n\r\n~ <p><i>Block crafting</i></p>. Realm Craft 3d makecraft offers you 100+ types of 3d blocks that can be used to build and create useful items as craftsman from cube;\r\n\r\n~ <p><i>Crafting mode</i></p>. Free block mining allows you and your friends craft, survive, mine and build 3d as craftsman!\r\n\r\n~ <p><i>Various game modes</i></p> - SURVIVAL and CREATIVE (crafting and building), World, MINI-GAMES (multi craft);\r\n\r\n~ Realmcraft is a 3D pixel mini craft simulator for building, crafting and farming as craftsman. Spawn eggs to get to know all the unique mobs, learn how to tame a wolf, ocelot and horse, start growing plants and set up your very own mini farm!\r\n\r\n~ <p><i>Multiplayer and 4 mini games!</i></p> Meet other craftsman and fans of building, craft and mine, chat with them, do joint construction block, and share 3d life hacks and secrets of the 3d block and cube.\r\n\r\n~ <p><i>World exploration</i></p>. In this 3d world craft adventure with colorful cubic graphics, many lite biomes await you: from forests and plains to deserts and mini taiga. In each biome, you will be greeted by unique mini flora and fauna and will be able to build craft shelters!\r\n\r\n<p>Survival mode</p>\r\nBuild and mine, collect resources, block and plants, beat enemies and go hunting to survive in survival mindcraft mode (single player).\u00a0\r\nMaster craft the secrets of surviving and go from simple wooden armor to strong diamond armor crafting!\u00a0\r\nUse enchantments to increase your damage and defense! Let the evil mobs regret meeting you!\u00a0\r\n\r\n<p>Creative mode</p>\r\nEnjoy unlimited creativity, immortality and flying in creative mode. Start your mini city building! Build your dream houses from cubes, or copy real-life landmarks and houses from 3d. Also here you become a real engineer, craftsman, creating mechanisms from 3d block.\r\n\r\n<p>Worlds and mini games</p>\r\nRealm craft sandbox has multiplayer mode Worlds: there are lot of huge and miniworld, isle craft, eers krafts and 3d pixel world. Make friends with real players from all globe and build open world together! Show players the mini buildings you create and give tips on crafting, surviving and building. Realm Craft has a private chat in which you communicate only with friends!\r\n\r\nIf you like creative & survival building - Realmcraft sandbox is exactly that!",
