and fauna and will be able to build craft shelters!<br><br><p>Survival mode</p><br>Build and mine, collect resources, block and plants, beat enemies and go hunting to survive in survival mindcraft mode (single player).\u00a0<br>Master craft the secrets of surviving and go from simple wooden armor to strong diamond armor crafting!\u00a0<br>Use enchantments to increase your damage and defense! Let the evil mobs regret meeting you!\u00a0<br><br><p>Creative mode</p><br>Enjoy unlimited creativity, immortality and flying in creative mode. Start your mini city building! Build your dream houses from cubes, or copy real-life landmarks and houses from 3d. Also here you become a real engineer, craftsman, creating mechanisms from 3d block.<br><br><p>Worlds and mini games</p><br>Realm craft sandbox has multiplayer mode Worlds: there are lot of huge and miniworld, isle craft, eers krafts and 3d pixel world. Make friends with real players from all globe and build open world together! Show players the mini buildings you create and give tips on crafting, surviving and building. Realm Craft has a private chat in which you communicate only with friends!<br><br>If you like creative &amp; survival building - Realmcraft sandbox is exactly that!",
